msgid ""
"<strong>Oqqushlar</strong> — to'y, fotiha, beshik to'yi va boshqa oilaviy "
"marosimlar uchun raqamli taklifnomalar tayyorlaydigan xizmat. Bosma "
"taklifnomadan farqli o'laroq, sizning taklifnomangiz oddiy havola bo'lib, "
"uni Telegram yoki boshqa istalgan joyda ulashasiz — mehmon uni telefonida "
"ochadi, manzilni xaritada ko'radi va \"kelaman\" deb javob beradi."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Oqqushlar</strong> is a service for creating digital invitations for"
" weddings, engagement ceremonies, cradle celebrations and other family "
"events. Unlike a paper invitation, yours is a simple link you share on "
"Telegram or anywhere else — the guest opens it on their phone, sees the "
"address on a map, and replies \"I'll come.\""

msgid ""
"Xizmatni o'zingiz boshqarasiz: dizaynni tanlaysiz, ma'lumotlarni to'ldirasiz"
" va taklifnoma shu zahoti tayyor bo'ladi. Bizga yozib o'tirish, kutish yoki "
"kelishuv shart emas — hammasi telefoningizda, bir necha daqiqada."
msgstr ""
"You're in full control: pick a design, fill in the details, and your "
"invitation is ready instantly. No need to message us, wait, or arrange "
"anything — it all happens on your phone, in a few minutes."

msgid "Sakkiz tilda"
msgstr "In eight languages"

msgid ""
"O'zbek, rus, ingliz, tojik, qozoq, qirg'iz, turkman va qoraqalpoq tillarida "
"— mehmonlaringiz taklifnomani o'z tilida o'qiydi."
msgstr ""
"In Uzbek, Russian, English, Tajik, Kazakh, Kyrgyz, Turkmen and Karakalpak — "
"your guests read the invitation in their own language."

msgid "Ro'yxatdan o'tish shart emas"
msgstr "No registration required"

msgid ""
"Email ham, parol ham so'ralmaydi. Yaratgan taklifnomalaringizni "
"\"Taklifnomalarim\" bo'limidan istalgan vaqt topasiz."
msgstr ""
"No email or password needed. You can always find the invitations you've "
"created in the \"My invitations\" section."

msgid "Har bir mehmonga shaxsiy havola"
msgstr "A personal link for every guest"

msgid ""
"Taklifnoma mehmonni ismi bilan kutib oladi, siz esa kim ko'rgani va kim "
"javob berganini kuzatib borasiz."
msgstr ""
"The invitation greets each guest by name, while you can see who has viewed "
"it and who has responded."

msgid "Avval ko'rasiz, keyin to'laysiz"
msgstr "See it first, pay later"

msgid ""
"Taklifnomangizni bepul yaratib, to'liq ko'rib chiqasiz. To'lov — faqat "
"yoqqanidan keyin."
msgstr ""
"You create and fully preview your invitation for free. Payment — only after "
"you like it."

msgid ""
"Savolingiz bormi yoki yordam kerakmi — xijolat bo'lmang, bizga yozing. Bepul"
" va samimiy yordam beramiz."
msgstr ""
"Have a question or need help? Don't hesitate — write to us. We'll help for "
"free and gladly."

msgid "Dizaynlarni ko'rish"
msgstr "View designs"

msgid ""
"Taklifnoma yaratishda yordam kerak bo'lsa, dizayn bo'yicha maxsus "
"so'rovingiz bo'lsa yoki to'lov haqida savolingiz bo'lsa — xijolat bo'lmang, "
"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri yozing. Bepul va samimiy yordam beramiz."
msgstr ""
"If you need help creating your invitation, have a special design request, or"
" a question about payment — don't hesitate, write to us directly. We'll help"
" for free and gladly."

msgid "Telegram"
msgstr "Telegram"

msgid "Eng tez yo'l — xabar yozsangiz, odatda shu kuniyoq javob beramiz."
msgstr "The fastest way — send us a message, we usually reply the same day."

msgid "Ko'p so'raladigan savollar"
msgstr "Frequently asked questions"

msgid ""
"To'lov qanday, havola qachongacha ishlaydi, ma'lumotni keyin o'zgartirsa "
"bo'ladimi — ko'p savollarga javob shu yerda tayyor."
msgstr ""
"How payment works, how long the link stays active, whether you can edit "
"details later — answers to the most common questions are right here."

msgid "Javoblarni ko'rish"
msgstr "View answers"

msgid "chiroyli raqamli taklifnomalar"
msgstr "beautiful digital invitations"

msgid "Eng go'zal kuningiz uchun"
msgstr "For your most beautiful day"

msgid "raqamli taklifnoma"
msgstr "a digital invitation"

msgid "Tez va oson"
msgstr "Fast and easy"

msgid "Telefonda o'zingiz yarating"
msgstr "Create it yourself on your phone"

msgid ""
"Dizaynni tanlang, ma'lumotlaringizni kiriting va tayyor taklifnomani shu "
"zahoti ko'ring — bor-yo'g'i 5 daqiqada, ro'yxatdan o'tmasdan. To'lov — faqat"
" yoqqanidan keyin."
msgstr ""
"Choose a design, enter your details and see your invitation instantly — in "
"just 5 minutes, no sign-up. Pay only if you love it."

msgid "Barcha dizaynlarni ko'rish"
msgstr "View all designs"

msgid "So'nggi taklifnomalar"
msgstr "Recent invitations"

msgid "Platformamizda faollashtirilgan taklifnomalardan namunalar"
msgstr "Examples of invitations activated on our platform"

msgid "Nega Oqqushlar?"
msgstr "Why Oqqushlar?"

msgid "Boshqalardan nima bilan farq qilamiz"
msgstr "What sets us apart"

msgid "To'lovsiz sinab ko'ring"
msgstr "Try it free"

msgid "Avval ko'ring, keyin qaror qiling"
msgstr "See it first, decide later"

msgid ""
"Ro'yxatdan o'tmasdan, hech narsa to'lamasdan taklifnomangizni to'liq "
"yaratib, o'z ko'zingiz bilan ko'rasiz. Yoqsagina to'lab faollashtirasiz."
msgstr ""
"No registration, no payment needed — build your full invitation and see it "
"with your own eyes first. Pay only once you like it, to activate it."

msgid "Har bir marosimga moslashgan"
msgstr "Built for every kind of event"

msgid "Forma marosim turingizni tushunadi"
msgstr "The form understands your event type"

msgid ""
"Nikoh to'yimi, xatna to'yimi yoki tug'ilgan kunmi — forma so'raydigan "
"savollar va na'munaviy matnlar aynan shu marosimga mos ravishda o'zgaradi."
msgstr ""
"Wedding, circumcision ceremony, or birthday — the questions the form asks "
"and the example texts change to match your exact event."

msgid "Kim ko'rgani ma'lum"
msgstr "Know who's seen it"

msgid "Shaxsiy statistika sahifangiz"
msgstr "Your own private statistics page"

msgid ""
"Har bir mehmoningiz uchun alohida link yaratib, kim ko'rganini, kim "
"\"kelaman\" deganini — hammasini faqat sizga ko'rinadigan sahifada kuzatib "
"borasiz."
msgstr ""
"Create a separate link for each guest and track — on a page only you can see"
" — who has seen it and who has said \"I'm coming\"."

msgid "Bir necha tilda"
msgstr "In several languages"

msgid "Mehmonlaringiz o'z tilida o'qiydi"
msgstr "Your guests read it in their own language"

msgid ""
"Taklifnoma o'zbek, rus, ingliz va boshqa bir necha tilda avtomatik ko'rinadi"
" — chet elda yoki boshqa millat vakili bo'lgan mehmonlaringiz ham "
"qiynalmaydi."
msgstr ""
"The invitation automatically appears in Uzbek, Russian, English and several "
"other languages — guests abroad or of another nationality won't struggle "
"either."

msgid "Istalgan qurilmada chiroyli"
msgstr "Beautiful on any device"

msgid "Telefon, planshet, kompyuter"
msgstr "Phone, tablet, computer"

msgid ""
"Taklifnomangiz qaysi qurilmadan ochilmasin — ko'rinishi bir xil darajada "
"sara va o'qish qulay bo'ladi."
msgstr ""
"No matter what device your invitation is opened on, it will look just as "
"elegant and easy to read."

msgid "Marosimdan keyin ham"
msgstr "Even after the event"

msgid "Esdalik sifatida saqlanib qoladi"
msgstr "Stays as a keepsake"

msgid ""
"Taklifnoma marosim o'tib ketgach ham o'chib qolmaydi — istalgan vaqt qayta "
"ochib, o'sha kunning iliqligini his qilishingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"The invitation doesn't disappear once the event is over — you can reopen it "
"anytime and feel the warmth of that day again."

msgid ""
"Taklifnoma yaratishda yordam kerak bo'lsa, <strong>xijolat bo'lmang</strong>"
" — Telegram orqali yozing, sizga bepul va samimiy yordam beramiz."
msgstr ""
"If you need help creating your invitation, <strong>don't be shy</strong> — "
"write to us on Telegram, we'll help you for free and gladly."

msgid "Telegram orqali yozish"
msgstr "Write on Telegram"

msgid "Qanday ishlaydi?"
msgstr "How does it work?"

msgid "Uch oddiy qadam — va taklifnomangiz tayyor"
msgstr "Three simple steps — and your invitation is ready"

msgid "Dizayn tanlang"
msgstr "Choose a design"

msgid ""
"Bir nechta tayyor shablondan o'zingizga yoqqanini tanlang — har biri o'ziga "
"xos uslubda."
msgstr ""
"Pick your favorite from several ready-made templates — each with its own "
"style."

msgid "Ma'lumotlarni to'ldiring"
msgstr "Fill in the details"

msgid ""
"Marosim turi, ismlar, sana, manzil, rasmlar va musiqa — hammasini o'zingiz "
"kiritasiz."
msgstr ""
"Event type, names, date, address, photos and music — you enter everything "
"yourself."

msgid "Ulashing"
msgstr "Share it"

msgid ""
"Tayyor taklifnomani ko'rib chiqing, yoqsa faollashtiring va yaqinlaringizga "
"Telegram yoki Instagram orqali yuboring."
msgstr ""
"Preview your invitation, activate it if you like it, and send it to loved "
"ones via Telegram or Instagram."

msgid "Dizayn shablonlari"
msgstr "Design templates"

msgid "Tanlang va shu zahoti o'zingiznikini yaratib ko'ring"
msgstr "Pick one and create yours right away"

msgid "so'm"
msgstr "UZS"

msgid "Barcha dizaynlar"
msgstr "All designs"

msgid "Taklifnoma hali faollashtirilmagan"
msgstr "Invitation not yet activated"

msgid "Bu taklifnoma sahifasi hali tayyor emas"
msgstr "This invitation page isn't ready yet"

msgid ""
"Bu havola hozircha faollashtirilmagan. Iltimos, taklifnoma egasi bilan "
"bog'laning."
msgstr "This link is not yet activated. Please contact the invitation owner."

msgid ""
"Bu ro'yxat sizning shu brauzerda yaratgan barcha taklifnomalaringizni "
"ko'rsatadi — ularni solishtirib, eng yoqqanini tanlashingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"This list shows all invitations you've created in this browser — compare "
"them and pick your favorite."

msgid "Yana bitta yaratish"
msgstr "Create another"

msgid "Birinchi taklifnomangizni yarating"
msgstr "Create your first invitation"

msgid "Faollashtirilgan"
msgstr "Activated"

msgid "To'lov kutilmoqda"
msgstr "Awaiting payment"

msgid "Ko'rish"
msgstr "View"

msgid "Statistika"
msgstr "Statistics"

msgid "Yoqdi"
msgstr "Like"

msgid ""
"DIQQAT: bu taklifnoma FAOLLASHTIRILGAN — mehmonlarga yuborilgan va RSVP "
"javoblari bo'lishi mumkin! O'chirilsa, darhol ko'rinmay qoladi (30 kun "
"ichida administratorga murojaat qilib tiklash mumkin). Rostdan ham davom "
"etasizmi?"
msgstr ""
"WARNING: this invitation is ACTIVATED — it may have been sent to guests and "
"have RSVP replies! If deleted, it will disappear immediately (you can "
"contact the administrator within 30 days to restore it). Are you sure you "
"want to continue?"

